# Not part of the image: documentation, packaging trees for OTHER targets, the
# test suite and the editor/CI configuration. None of it is copied by the
# Dockerfile, and everything in the build context is sent to the daemon whether
# it is used or not.
#
# releases/ is NOT here: the Dockerfile COPYs several scripts out of it
# (resolve-node-source.sh, bundle-trim.mjs, the ferretdb entrypoint, ...), so
# excluding it would break the image build.
docs/
meta/
old-CHANGELOG/
openapi/
sandstorm-src/
snap-src/
snap-base-debian/
stacksmith/
tests/
secrets/
